                    by Wells and initialed by White.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d68-f2" n="1" xml:id="d68-f2-content">
                <p>Kreisky was in the United States to attend the 14th Session of the U.N. General Assembly and the annual meeting of the
                    International Bank for Reconstruction and Development.</p>
            </note>
